      "id": "claim_f280af0f433546cf9b730b163dd9f34c",
      "statement": "The qmd CLI parses its arguments with node util parseArgs and declares the retrieval flags -n, --min-score, --all, --full, --format, -c/--collection (repeatable), --filter, --from, -l, --max-bytes, --line-numbers, --no-line-numbers, and --full-path.",
